{"_id":"69a841a467b3dcfd36908b88","title":"GLEB HUB V9 by me","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9be67e5e840c8b8e2c5eb7295ca6b56536cb61b2473a5c49c4961c1099877fb3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1772634532947.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9be67e5e840c8b8e2c5eb7295ca6b56536cb61b2473a5c49c4961c1099877fb3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1772634532947.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-GLEB-HUB-V9-by-me-128525","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":847,"executes":1304,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/29ffb7ae768f918eb4239450faf667afaef189f79e017fce6d22edb5e71bb45f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1772634532947.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1772634532947.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/29ffb7ae768f918eb4239450faf667afaef189f79e017fce6d22edb5e71bb45f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1772634532947.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1772634532947.png"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-04T14:28:52.965Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-04T14:28:52.965Z","lastBump":"2026-03-04T14:28:52.965Z","script":"-- Original by gleb8282822\n-- GUI by Botakkkkk (Gleb Hub V9)\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RealBatu20/AI-Scripts-2025/refs/heads/main/glebhubv9.lua\"))()","features":"Original by @gleb8282822. GUI by Botakkkkk (me).\nTESTED ON XENO.\n\nFeatures by me:\n[+] Close & Minimize button.\n[+] ENG & RU languages.\n[+] Sorting (Relevance, A-Z, Z-A, Newest & Oldest).\n[+] Dark / Light Mode.\n[+] Add Scripts button.\n[+] Pagination (each pages will only show 10 scripts).\n[+] GLEB button, draggable.\n[+] Delete script button with confirmation.\n[+] Timestamp & Date to each script.\nThat's all...\n\nENG:\nHOW TO USE:\n- Main Window: Displays your script collection in a paginated grid (10 items per page)\n- Add Script (+): Click to open the \"New Script\" dialog where you can enter a script name and paste Lua code\n- Sort Button: Cycles through sorting options (Relevance, A-Z, Z-A, Newest, Oldest)\n- Language Button (ENG/RU): Switches the entire interface between English and Russian\n- Theme Button: Toggles between Dark and Light themes\n- Minimize (-): Collapses the hub to a small \"GLEB\" button on the left side; click the button to restore\n- Close (x): Completely closes and destroys the GUI\n- Script Cards: Click the card to execute the script, click the red \"x\" to delete it\n- Pagination: Use < and > buttons to navigate between pages\n\nThe watermark at the bottom credits the original creator (gleb8282822) and GUI designer (Botakkkkk).\n\nRU:\nКАК ПОЛЬЗОВАТЬСЯ:\n- Главное окно: Отображает коллекцию скриптов в сетке с постраничным выводом (10 элементов на страницу)\n- Добавить скрипт (+): Открывает диалог \"Новый скрипт\" для ввода названия и вставки Lua-кода\n- Кнопка сортировки: Переключает режимы сортировки (Релевантность, А-Я, Я-А, Новые, Старые)\n- Кнопка языка (ENG/RU): Переключает весь интерфейс между английским и русским языками\n- Кнопка темы: Переключает между темной и светлой темами\n- Свернуть (-): Сворачивает хаб в маленькую кнопку \"GLEB\" слева; нажмите кнопку для восстановления\n- Закрыть (x): Полностью закрывает и уничтожает GUI\n- Карточки скриптов: Нажмите на карточку для выполнения скрипта, красный \"x\" для удаления\n- Постраничная навигация: Используйте кнопки < и > для перехода между страницами\n\nВодяной знак внизу указывает авторов оригинала (gleb8282822) и дизайнера GUI (Botakkkkk).\n\n\nOPEN SOURCE, NO KEY, FREE.","tags":["glebhub","gleb","hub"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"664b971b7b31a40c47060765","username":"Irfannnnn","verified":false,"p